---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { appData as siteData } from "../../data"; 
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | UK Fuel Prices" 
  description="Privacy policy for the UK Fuel Prices & Petrol Map mobile application by El Mate Company"
  appData={siteData}
>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 mt-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <img src="/assets/ukfuels/iconoUKFuels.png" alt="UK Fuel Prices Icon" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800" />
            <div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">El Mate Company</span>
                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
                    Privacy Policy
                </h1>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8 font-semibold">
            Last updated: September 2026 • Effective Date: September 2026
        </p>
        
        <div class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
            <p>
                This Privacy Policy governs the mobile application <strong>UK Fuel Prices & Petrol Map</strong> (the "App"), developed and published by <strong>El Mate Company</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"). We are strongly committed to protecting your personal data in compliance with the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">1. 100% Anonymous by Design (No Account Required)</h2>
            <p>
                UK Fuel Prices is designed to be used completely anonymously. We do not require you to create an account, register an email address, or provide any personally identifiable information (such as your name, phone number, or home address) to use the App.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">2. Information Collection and Processing</h2>
            
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mt-6 mb-2">a. Real-Time Location (Foreground Geolocation)</h3>
            <p>
                The App requires access to your device's GPS location solely while the App is actively in use (foreground). This permission is used exclusively to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li>Center the map around your current location and display nearby petrol stations and EV chargers.</li>
                <li>Calculate distances and suggest cost-effective pitstops along your planned route.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 italic">
                We do not track your location in the background when the App is closed, nor do we store any history of your movements on our servers.
            </p>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mt-6 mb-2">b. Anonymous Authentication</h3>
            <p>
                To interact securely with our cloud backend (Supabase), the App automatically generates an anonymous, random token. This identifier does not link to any real-world identity.
            </p>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mt-6 mb-2">c. Local Device Storage (Offline Database)</h3>
            <p>
                Your vehicle configuration (tank capacity, fuel type, average consumption), saved favorite stations, and Fuel Logbook fill-up records are stored <strong>strictly locally on your device</strong> in an internal database (Room/SQLite). This data remains on your phone and is never uploaded to our servers as personal profile data.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>
                The App utilizes reputable third-party service providers that may process technical or device-level identifiers:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Google Play Services & Apple App Store:</strong> Provide core operating system functionality and secure in-app purchase processing.</li>
                <li><strong>Google AdMob:</strong> Displays advertisements in the free version. AdMob may process device advertising identifiers (Google Advertising ID or Apple IDFA, subject to your tracking consent choices) to deliver ads.</li>
                <li><strong>RevenueCat:</strong> Manages anonymous purchase receipts and validates PRO lifetime access. RevenueCat never receives your credit card or payment credentials; all transactions are processed directly by Apple or Google.</li>
                <li><strong>Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM):</strong> If you choose to enable price alerts for favorite petrol stations, an anonymous push token is generated to route price notifications to your device.</li>
                <li><strong>Firebase Crashlytics:</strong> Collects anonymous crash logs, device models, and OS versions to diagnose technical bugs and improve app stability.</li>
                <li><strong>Mapbox / Google Maps / OpenStreetMap:</strong> Used for map tile rendering, routing, and address searches.</li>
                <li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Provides backend infrastructure and encrypted API transmission.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">4. Lawful Basis for Processing (UK GDPR)</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Consent:</strong> For location permissions and push notifications, which you can grant or revoke at any time in your device settings.</li>
                <li><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong> To maintain app performance, prevent fraud, and display relevant fuel data.</li>
                <li><strong>Contractual Performance:</strong> To deliver and validate UK Fuel Prices PRO features purchased by the user.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">5. Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                UK Fuel Prices is designed for licensed drivers and general audiences. We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal data from children under the age of 13.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">6. Data Retention & Deletion</h2>
            <p>
                Because your vehicle garage, favorite stations, and fuel logs are stored locally on your device, deleting the App removes all local data permanently.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">7. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>
                If you have any questions or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your data, please contact us at:
            </p>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
                <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">El Mate Company</p>
                <p class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
                    <a href="mailto:elmatecompany@gmail.com">elmatecompany@gmail.com</a>
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Website: <a href="https://www.elmatecompany.com" class="underline">www.elmatecompany.com</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
